{"node_id": "nd002", "text": "To feel competent", "depth": 2, "parent_id": "nd001", "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.8, "confidence_raw": 0.8, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000508-mem_needstate-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Studied hard for that ACT and got a score I'm really happy with.", "char_start": 34, "char_end": 98}, {"session_id": "p000508-mem_needstate-s1", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "The scholarship stuff feels like the next hurdle though.", "char_start": 85, "char_end": 141}, {"session_id": "p000508-mem_needstate-s1", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "It's just that I'm not sure if my application is strong enough.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 63}, {"session_id": "p000508-mem_needstate-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Things felt a bit more tense around my scholarship application. I think it's just the deadline looming", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 102}, {"session_id": "p000508-mem_needstate-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "I've revised it so many times, but I still worry about missing something crucial. How do I know if I’ve done enough?", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 116}, {"session_id": "p000508-mem_needstate-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Just wondering if taking that break was the right call.", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 96}, {"session_id": "p000508-mem_needstate-s3", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "I'm not sure if it was the right call. I feel like all my revisions might have been for nothing.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 96}, {"session_id": "p000508-mem_needstate-s3", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "I guess some of the revisions might have helped a bit, but I'm still worried if it was all worth it.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 100}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261012T215646Z", "last_updated_at": "20261012T222248Z", "first_seen_session": "p000508-mem_needstate-s1", "last_session": "p000508-mem_needstate-s3", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 3}
