{"node_id": "nd004", "text": "To share good news", "depth": 2, "parent_id": "nd001", "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.6, "confidence_raw": 0.6, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000508-mem_needstate-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "How about you?", "char_start": 99, "char_end": 113}, {"session_id": "p000508-mem_needstate-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Studied hard for that ACT and got a score I'm really happy with.", "char_start": 34, "char_end": 98}, {"session_id": "p000508-mem_needstate-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "I'm feeling pretty good actually. Studied hard for that ACT and got a score I'm really happy with.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 98}, {"session_id": "p000508-mem_needstate-s1", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "I'm really glad it's all over—I mean, my ACT is done. Got some scholarship stuff to worry about now, but overall, a big weight lifted.", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 158}, {"session_id": "p000508-mem_needstate-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Things felt a bit more tense around my scholarship application. I think it's just the deadline looming", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 102}, {"session_id": "p000508-mem_needstate-s2", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "What if there's something I missed?", "char_start": 78, "char_end": 113}, {"session_id": "p000508-mem_needstate-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Things felt a bit more tense around my scholarship application.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 63}, {"session_id": "p000508-mem_needstate-s2", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "It's just that I've spent so many nights on this, and I worry it might not be enough. What if my efforts aren't recognized?", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 123}, {"session_id": "p000508-mem_needstate-s2", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "I've been going over it so many times, but still, I feel like something isn't quite right. What if my efforts don’t pay off?", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 124}, {"session_id": "p000508-mem_needstate-s2", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "What do you think?", "char_start": 187, "char_end": 205}, {"session_id": "p000508-mem_needstate-s2", "turn_index": 17, "quote": "Thanks for the advice!", "char_start": 90, "char_end": 112}, {"session_id": "p000508-mem_needstate-s2", "turn_index": 19, "quote": "I appreciate the suggestion to take a break. I think sometimes I just need to step away and come back with fresh eyes. Thanks for the advice!", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 141}, {"session_id": "p000508-mem_needstate-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Just wondering if taking that break was the right call.", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 96}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261012T215646Z", "last_updated_at": "20261012T221559Z", "first_seen_session": "p000508-mem_needstate-s1", "last_session": "p000508-mem_needstate-s3", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 3}
